        <mxCell id="c141" value="&lt;b&gt;Trust boundaries.&lt;/b&gt; W1 is the only public-facing hop and is where every directory deny rule and the dotfile block are enforced. Outbound calls to third-party geocoding and tile services originate only from P4 and P5; no client-supplied value reaches those providers except through validated coordinates." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
